Joseph Wright a &eacute;crit&nbsp;:
<blockquote cite="mid:E1NGF7g-0001eB-Dp@pr-webmail-1.mail.demon.net"
 type="cite">
  <pre wrap=""><a class="moz-txt-link-abbreviated" href="mailto:frnchfrgg@FREE.FR">frnchfrgg@FREE.FR</a> wrote:
